{'symbol': 'CARR', 'date': '2023-06-22 09:35:00', 'title': 'HABITAT FOR HUMANITY INTERNATIONAL AND CARRIER GLOBAL CORPORATION COLLABORATE DURING NATIONAL HEALTHY HOMES MONTH TO DRIVE ACCESS TO SAFE, AFFORDABLE HOMES', 'text': "ATLANTA , JUNE 22, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- THIS MONTH, HABITAT FOR HUMANITY INTERNATIONAL AND\xa0CARRIER GLOBAL CORPORATION\xa0(NYSE: CARR) ARE COLLABORATING TO HIGHLIGHT THE WAY IN WHICH ACCESS TO A HEALTHY, SAFE AND AFFORDABLE HOME MAY FOSTER AND IMPROVE OCCUPANTS' HEALTH DURING NATIONAL HEALTHY HOMES MONTH, WHICH TAKES PLACE ANNUALLY IN JUNE.\xa0\xa0 THROUGH NATIONAL HEALTHY HOMES MONTH, THE\xa0U.S. DEPARTMENT OF HOUSING AND URBAN DEVELOPMENT\xa0SEEKS TO INCREASE AWARENESS OF THE CRITICAL NEED FOR HEALTHIER AND SAFER HOUSING, WITH THE OVERALL GOAL OF IMPROVING THE HEALTH OF INDIVIDUALS AND FAMILIES, WITH PARTICULAR FOCUS ON VULNERABLE POPULATIONS."}